**æ–‡ä»¶ A æ–°å¢ž** `backend/deskpet/tools/ppt_outline_store.py`ï¼ˆä»¿ `skill_codifier` çš?waiters + ä»?`receipt_store`/SessionDB çš„æŒä¹…åŒ–ï¼‰ï¼š
- `class PPTOutlineWaiters`ï¼š`dict[str, asyncio.Future]`ï¼Œ`add(oid, fut)/resolve(oid, decision)/pop(oid)`ï¼ˆç…§æ?`SkillCandidateWaiters` @skill_codifier:285-317ï¼‰ã€?- **åŽ†å²æŒä¹…åŒ?*ï¼ˆç”¨æˆ·è¦ã€Œå­˜åŽ†å²å¤§çº²ã€ï¼‰ï¼š`ppt_outline_history` è¡¨ï¼ˆSessionDBï¼Œä»¿ `ensure_session_goals_table` çš?flag-gated å»ºè¡¨ï¼Œ`pro_outline_history` å¼€æ‰å»ºï¼Œä¿ BC å­—èŠ‚åŸºçº¿ï¼‰ã€‚å­—æ®µï¼š`outline_id TEXT PK, session_id, topic, created_at, slides_json TEXT, sources_count INT, status TEXT(proposed/accepted/rejected/superseded)`ã€?  - `save_outline(oid, sid, topic, slides, sources)` / `mark_status(oid, status)` / `list_history(sid, limit=20)` / `get_outline(oid)`ï¼ˆä¾›ã€Œä»ŽåŽ†å²å¤ç”¨ã€ï¼‰ã€?
**æ–‡ä»¶ B æ–°å¢ž** `backend/main.py`ï¼ˆä»¿ `_maybe_codify_skill` @709-835ï¼Œä½†ç”?ppt ç¼–æŽ’ task ä¸»åŠ¨è°ƒï¼Œä¸èµ° turn-end hookï¼‰ï¼š
- æ¨¡å—çº?`_PPT_OUTLINE_WAITERS = PPTOutlineWaiters()`ã€?- `async def _ppt_outline_propose(sid, *, topic, slides, sources_count, outline_md, no_research) -> str(decision)`ï¼?  ```python
  oid = uuid4().hex
  if cfg.pro_outline_history: outline_store.save_outline(oid, sid, topic, slides, sources_count)
  payload = {"outline_id": oid, "topic": topic, "outline_md": outline_md, "session_id": sid,
             "sources_count": sources_count, "no_research": no_research,
             "history": outline_store.list_history(sid, 20) if cfg.pro_outline_history else []}
  await _broadcast_control({"type": "ppt_outline_proposed", "payload": payload})  # è§ä¸‹ MAJOR-1
  fut = loop.create_future(); _PPT_OUTLINE_WAITERS.add(oid, fut)
  try:    decision = await asyncio.wait_for(fut, cfg.pro_confirm_timeout_s)   # {action, feedback?, reuse_id?}
  except asyncio.TimeoutError: decision = {"action": "cancel"}
  except asyncio.CancelledError: outline_store.mark_status(oid, "cancelled"); _PPT_OUTLINE_WAITERS.pop(oid); raise
  finally: _PPT_OUTLINE_WAITERS.pop(oid)
  outline_store.mark_status(oid, _status_of(decision))
  return decision
  ```
